# Git and pull request hygiene

- Do not prefix branch names with `cursor/`. Use a short informative name only.
- Do not add Cursor marketing or attribution to commits, PR titles, or PR bodies
  (including footers like "Made with Cursor" or links to cursor.com).
- Keep PR descriptions limited to summary and test plan content the user asked for.
